From 95ef909c25e26e79fc6940b19d5ac1c0229dcf1f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 12:26:33 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Lapin UX: publish _NET_WORKAREA for X11 apps (the screen
 minus the taskbar)

X11 apps that place their own pop-ups (Steam's friend toasts) use it to stay
clear of panels; cosmic-comp never set it, so they covered the taskbar.
Updated when layer surfaces map, change their exclusive zone or go away,
when outputs change and when Xwayland's scale changes. Refs #28
